  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Riksbanken 2025-28</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Riksbank 2025-28</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med Riksbankens TA &#xe4;r att:

&#x2022; genom kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring, utbildning och r&#xe5;dgivning, inom omr&#xe5;den d&#xe4;r Riksbanken har unik kompetens, st&#xe4;rka Riksbankens samarbetsl&#xe4;nders centralbanker (partnerbankerna) som institutioner samt

&#x2022; m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l bredare kunskapsutbyten mellan Riksbanken och partnerbankerna som tillf&#xe4;lliga personalutbyten</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Riksbank&apos;s TA is to:
&#x2022; through knowledge transfer, training and advice, in areas where the Riksbank has unique expertise, strengthen the central banks of the Riksbank&apos;s partner countries (the partner banks) as institutions, and
&#x2022; enable both broader exchanges of knowledge between the Riksbank and the partner banks as well as temporary staff exchanges</narrative>
  </description>
